  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Hello Nonce",
      "items": [
        "PLAIN/RANDOM/AUTH_SIG/CERT_CHAIN 都先发 ClientHello/ServerHello 随机 nonce；KDF 双方 nonce + 模式独立输出会话密钥"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Security Guards",
      "items": [
        "CERT_CHAIN：若无证书链直接拒绝；AUTH_SIG：签名错直接 drop，不复用连接；避免明文可 downgrade 攻击"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Ordinal Contract",
      "items": [
        "P2PCommand enum.ordinal 在 Java/Dart/Python/C/TS 生成的 wire format 必须完全一致；改动 enum 顺序会引起跨语言不可互操作，需 p2p-core-wire-format 重新发布"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
